 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Hud: no motif, no figure. Their accusations (66:7-14) are not glossed, only framed «رادين لدعوته، قادحين في رأيه»; their challenge (70:11-17) not glossed. Geometric for «اعبدوا الله», an hourglass for «خلفاء من بعد قوم نوح», light for «فاذكروا آلاء الله». STAGING v4: Hud is a blue drop labelled Hud (no motif on his name); 'Ad's chiefs are three faceless men in dark robes in a desert land (As-Sa'di: they lived in the land of Yemen; no other place detail is drawn). c1 (65-68): Hud speaks (65:5), geometric on 65:7-13 (worship Allah), the camera on them for the warning (65:14); the chiefs answer (66:1) and shake their heads on 66:10 (foolishness) and 66:14 (liars); Hud answers (67:1, 68:1), a seal plate for the messages of his Lord (68:1-3), the camera on them on 68:4 (a sincere adviser to you). c2 (69-70): Hud speaks (69:1); hourglass for successors after the people of Nuh (69:11-16, it ends before Nuh's name); the camera on them for their stature (69:19); light plate for the favours of Allah (69:23-25, not starting on the Name); they answer (70:1), shake their heads (70:2, 70:14) and speak their challenge (70:11). The idols are never drawn. No punishment in this video."
 },
